  "2026-10-20T10:11:21.908Z",codex-agent,"The detached behavioral revert fails 4/4 regressions including stale-pidfile cleanup and preservation of a live owned pidfile. Removing only the database entry from doctor checks and rebuilding fails its regression 1/1, exit 1. Fixed code restored. The no-git SDK test is compatibility acceptance of already-working behavior, not a new defect claim."
  "2026-10-20T10:21:19.637Z",codex-agent,Linked detached regression selection passed 4/4 (exit 0) through pm test --run --progress --only-last with source/schema context. Existing result tracking is disabled. No items closed.
  "2026-10-20T13:55:16.874Z",codex-agent,"Native Bun execution also starts a real detached built server, returns only after HTTP 200 health, survives launcher exit, and stops successfully. PID ownership and failure cleanup are covered by real-process source and built-wrapper contracts. Runtime/test/schema inputs will remain frozen during final sequential npm and Bun release checks."
  "2026-10-20T14:49:18.367Z",codex-agent,"Final npm and Bun full release checks both pass with the same 393 frozen runtime/test/schema/build inputs: 699/699 tests each, capacity 2/2 and packed consumers 4/4 each. Source and built detached lifecycle regressions pass, including immediate health after launcher exit, existing live PID ownership, stale state removal and cleanup on failure/timeout. Native Bun start/health/stop also passes. Original history prefix is preserved; claims are released without closing items."
